### ClaimCheckPlayground — Producer API Test Requests
### Run the Aspire AppHost first, then update the port numbers below.
### Use Visual Studio "Endpoints Explorer" or the VS Code REST Client extension.

@ProducerBaseUrl = https://localhost:49955

# ── Submit a simple order ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Expected: 202 Accepted  { claimToken, orderId }
POST {{ProducerBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-42",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "SKU-001", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 29.99 },
    { "productId": "SKU-005", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 149.00 }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": {
    "street": "123 Main St",
    "city": "Seattle",
    "postalCode": "98101",
    "country": "US"
  }
}

###

# ── Submit an order with multiple items ───────────────────────────────────
# Demonstrates that any payload size fits the pattern without touching SB limits.
POST {{ProducerBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "enterprise-corp",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "SKU-010", "quantity": 100, "unitPrice": 4.99 },
    { "productId": "SKU-020", "quantity": 50,  "unitPrice": 9.99 },
    { "productId": "SKU-030", "quantity": 20,  "unitPrice": 24.99 },
    { "productId": "SKU-040", "quantity": 5,   "unitPrice": 199.99 }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": {
    "street": "1 Enterprise Blvd",
    "city": "New York",
    "postalCode": "10001",
    "country": "US"
  }
}

###

# ── Validation error — no items ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Expected: 400 Bad Request  { errors: { Items: [...] } }
POST {{ProducerBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-99",
  "items": [],
  "shippingAddress": {
    "street": "99 Empty St",
    "city": "Portland",
    "postalCode": "97201",
    "country": "US"
  }
}

###
